#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:8
msgid "Support OpenAI's Responses protocol with `provider.api = \"responses\"` (also inferred from a `/responses` URL), including standardized reasoning effort, flattened function tools, tool-result round trips, cached-token usage, stateless requests, and replay of opaque reasoning items across turns."
msgstr "支持 OpenAI Responses 协议：可设置 `provider.api = \"responses\"`，也可从 `/responses` URL 推断；包括标准 reasoning effort、扁平 function tool、tool result 往返、缓存 token 用量、无状态请求，以及跨轮回放不透明 reasoning item。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:9
msgid "Add a dedicated Providers documentation page covering configuration, protocol selection, reasoning, caching, strict tools, compatibility profiles, and their official references."
msgstr "新增独立的 Provider 文档页，说明配置、协议选择、reasoning、缓存、strict tools、兼容性 profile 及其官方依据。"

